# Build context for apps/*/Dockerfile is the repository root. Keep it small (faster uploads, fewer
# cache misses) and keep anything secret or machine-specific out of the images.

# Dependencies and build output: images install and build from scratch.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/cdk.out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Local environment and secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.localstack

# Test and tool artefacts.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed to build or run the apps.
.git
.github
docs
docker
*.md
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
